WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.936
Welcome to the 48- Hour Job Search Strategy.

2
00:00:03.735 --> 00:00:05.462
Now, this does not mean you're supposed

3
00:00:05.462 --> 00:00:07.548
to find a job in 48 hours.

4
00:00:07.548 --> 00:00:08.865
It means we're going to use those

5
00:00:08.865 --> 00:00:10.903
first 48 hours to build momentum.

6
00:00:11.332 --> 00:00:13.468
Instead of randomly applying and hoping something

7
00:00:13.468 --> 00:00:16.247
happens, you'll build a focused plan, activate

8
00:00:16.247 --> 00:00:18.724
your network, get your materials ready, and

9
00:00:18.724 --> 00:00:20.675
create a system you can keep using.

10
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.327
You don't need a perfect job search.

11
00:00:23.327 --> 00:00:25.083
You need a strong next move.

12
00:00:25.083 --> 00:00:25.980
Let's build it.
